# One offline journey, real local rules, fixed plans and explicit source drift.
name: Exact accepted files bind a finite study and real native discovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/exact_scope.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/alpha-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | imported-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | accepted-map
keys: Escape
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-boundary
keys: f
require-live-snap: 25 Files 1..3 of 3 | literal-membership
expect: [route].py
expect: root file.py
ask: Are literal root files and the accepted boundary visible without starting discovery or implying that spending was approved?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 p study | closed-file-page
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study-form
expect: Selected scope
ask: Does the visible scope action supply the exact reference, retain engine choices and explain that other boundaries remain unplanned?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | exact-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/exact_scope.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 15 Source and context | identities-120x36
ask: Does the draft show its exact scope reference, source identity and three fixed passes, with approval still required?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: identities-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: identities-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: identities-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: identities-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: identities-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: identities-small-paged
ask: Can the operator page through source and scope identities at 40x12 without losing the form or approving jobs?
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: identities-small-last
ask: Can the operator reach the final receipt guidance while keeping Source and context selected?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 ACCEPTED SCOPES | scope-restored
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 options[sast:scan] | scope-closed
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PREREQUISITE PLAN | native-prerequisite
keys: r
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/exact_scope.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scanned
submit: workbench
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT READY | exact-native-result
expect: Viewing Scan
expect: Review saved scan options
ask: Does the separately requested native scan report two real local-rule observations and keep the unapproved three-pass study separate?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/exact_scope.py @TMP_TARGET @ART change-source
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 source content changed | refused-source-drift
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/exact_scope.py @TMP_TARGET @ART drift
ask: Does changed source refuse another scan and explain how to refresh the scope, while preserving the earlier observations and fixed draft?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | saved-boundary-no-color
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/exact_scope.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: After real exit and no-color restart, is the saved boundary readable as recorded evidence without launching jobs or declaring findings fixed?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
